agedu
------------------------------------------
Unix utility for tracking down wasted disk space

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://www.chiark.greenend.org.uk/~sgtatham/agedu/

Canonical download:
  https://www.chiark.greenend.org.uk/~sgtatham/agedu/agedu-20260410.3622eda.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack agedu-20260410.3622eda-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./agedu-20260410.3622eda-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/agedu-20260410.3622eda-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/agedu-20260410.3622eda-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(agedu)
  /usr/bin/agedu.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/agedu.README
  /usr/share/doc/agedu/LICENCE
  /usr/share/doc/agedu/TODO
  /usr/share/man/man1/agedu.1.gz

------------------

